	"$yuf_localizer_catalog_description": "## Setup\nClick settings button at the bottom of the menu, copy paste project urls and lang codes into form\n## Navigate\nUse keyboard arrows to navigate between keys in list\n## Filter marks\n❓ Keys to translate, exists only in the sources as en locale\n☑️ Changed, but not committed keys, exists only in the browser local storage\n⚠️ Obsolete keys that exist only in localStorage but not in the selected project sources (may be deleted or renamed in the project)\n## Importing into modules\nBest way - to merge changes into all mam modules and share locales between projects.\n* commit changes in your projects\n* build project to ensure all deps downloaded\n* download or copypaste **all changes** into mam root via diskette button in menu header\n* run \"node yuf/localizer/merge/cli.mjs --update\"\n* make pull requests from affected namespaces, which cli returns\n## Overriding in application\nUse, if you can't commit some keys to the mol ecosystem.\n* download or copypaste selected locale via diskette button in menu header\n* place it into builded application source directory as app.locale=ru.json\n* commit locale into your app project",
